期，百夫荷罕旗以先驅。武王弟叔振鐸奉陳常車，周公旦把大鉞，畢公把小鉞，以夾武王。散宜生、太顛、閎夭皆執劍以衛武王。既入，立于社南大卒之左，右畢從。毛叔鄭奉明水，衛康叔封布茲，召公奭贊采，師尚父牽牲。尹佚筴祝曰：「殷之末孫季紂，殄廢先王明德，侮蔑神祇不祀，昏暴商邑百姓，其章顯聞于天皇上帝。」於是武王再拜稽首，曰：「膺更大命，革殷，受天明命。」武王又再拜稽首，乃出。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"叔振鐸","kind":"person","person_id":"f1l_p1w_796","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"畢公","kind":"person","person_id":"ngh_196_gz6","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"散宜生","kind":"person","person_id":"1dm_ebc_uzk","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太顛","kind":"person","person_id":"5pr_wl7_dk1","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"閎夭","kind":"person","person_id":"hv8_0ce_lw9","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0088","start":88,"end":91,"surface":"毛叔鄭","kind":"person","person_id":"utj_s5y_tae","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0095","start":95,"end":99,"surface":"衛康叔封","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AE","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0102","start":102,"end":105,"surface":"召公奭","kind":"person","person_id":"7m7_qvm_4oj","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0108","start":108,"end":111,"surface":"師尚父","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"尹佚","kind":"person","person_id":"mo4_tlr_3fh","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"季紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p018","text":"封商紂子祿父殷之餘民。武王為殷初定未集，乃使其弟管叔鮮、蔡叔度相祿父治殷。已而命召公釋箕子之囚。命畢公釋百姓之囚，表商容之閭。命南宮括散鹿臺之財，發鉅橋之粟，以振貧弱萌隸。命南宮括、史佚展九鼎保玉。命閎夭封比干之墓。命宗祝享祠于軍。乃罷兵西歸。行狩，記政事，作《武成》。封諸侯，班賜宗彝，作《分殷之器物》。武王追思先聖王，乃褒封神農之後於焦，黃帝之後於祝，帝堯之後於薊，帝舜之後於陳，大禹之後於杞。於是封功臣謀士，而師尚父為首封。封尚父於營丘，曰齊。封弟周公旦於曲阜，曰魯。封召公奭於燕。封弟叔鮮于管，弟叔度於蔡。餘各以次受封。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"祿父","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"管叔鮮","kind":"person","per