,"surface":"神農之後","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"帝堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"大禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0208","start":208,"end":211,"surface":"師尚父","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"尚父","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0227","start":227,"end":230,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0238","start":238,"end":241,"surface":"召公奭","kind":"person","person_id":"7m7_qvm_4oj","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0246","start":246,"end":248,"surface":"叔鮮","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AB","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m018-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"叔度","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AC","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p003","text":"或曰，太公博聞，嘗事紂。紂無道，去之。游說諸侯，無所遇，而卒西歸周西伯。或曰，呂尚處士，隱海濱。周西伯拘羑里，散宜生、閎夭素知而招呂尚。呂尚亦曰「吾聞西伯賢，又善養老，盍往焉」。三人者為西伯求美女奇物，獻之於紂，以贖西伯。西伯得以出，反國。言呂尚所以事周雖異，然要之為文武師。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m003-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surfa